**/node_modules/

# ── Build / tool caches (never commit) ──────────────────────────────
**/.cache/
**/node_modules/.cache/
**/.eslintcache
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.turbo/
**/.next/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Generated output ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE: build/ is NOT ignored yet: smreact/smreact/build and
# Super-Admin-Frontend/build are still tracked (a deploy may use them).
# Once deploys build from source, add `**/build/` here and untrack them.
**/dist/
**/coverage/

# ── Logs / temp ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Local env overrides ─────────────────────────────────────────────
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
